## ai-specview

When elaborating a spec, use the `spec-elaborate` skill. Show the spec with
`spec_show` and ask every clarifying question with the ai-specview `ask` tool,
quoting the spec verbatim (`spec_quote` + `spec_section`) and pointing at the
code (`code_refs`, Go symbols preferred). Do not ask clarifying questions in
plain chat while ai-specview is reachable.
